Error [jet.FormActionInputMismatch]: The web.form model `Checkout` is not marked `#Web.Form`
  --> tests/ui/e2474_form_model_needs_form_marker.jet:11:20
    |
 11 |     form: web.form(Checkout, action: submit)
    |                    ^^^^^^^^
 Why: A form derives its fields only from a model struct the web module's `#Form` marks
 Fix: Mark the model: `#Web.Form Checkout: struct { ... }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2474
